iv class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/964724-whens-next-2nd-edition-book-coming-out?p=989199#post989199\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Because fulfilling all of them would be a fucking nightmare?</div> </div> </div> </div>... man if they got the backing money, it must be terrible to have to produce content, whilst being paid up front, and up front payment can gain interest... sounds like a terrible burden","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-19T00:12:54-07:00","id":989756,"title":"","content":"Unless I misinterpreting your post I think you are underestimating how much time and effort running a kickstarter needs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-19T11:57:15-07:00","id":989998,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xenoterracide</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/964724-whens-next-2nd-edition-book-coming-out?p=989711#post989711\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">... man if they got the backing money, it must be terrible to have to produce content, whilst being paid up front, and up front payment can gain interest... sounds like a terrible burden</div> </div> </div> </div>Man, have you SEEN how toxic the Exalted community became when E3 took longer than expected? The book is out, the Kickstarter has been fulfilled, but people are <i>still</i> bitter about the delay <i>because</i> they paid up front. If anything, Kickstarting E3 proved that existing fan bases turn against when you Kickstart the product they want if it doesn't turn out just the way they want it in the time they think is reasonable. Paying up front has a way of making people entitled as hell.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":269,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","user":"Charlaquin","date":". 10-19-2016, 03:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-19T12:23:11-07:00","id":990020,"title":"","content":"Yeah. I backed Exalted 3e but it became pretty untenable to follow discussion <i>about</i> 3e because people got so harsh. I mostly kept up through Monday Meeting Notes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-19T12:35:08-07:00","id":990032,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/964724-whens-next-2nd-edition-book-coming-out?p=989998#post989998\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Man, have you SEEN how toxic the Exalted community became when E3 took longer than expected? The book is out, the Kickstarter has been fulfilled, but people are <i>still</i> bitter about the delay <i>because</i> they paid up front. If anything, Kickstarting E3 proved that existing fan bases turn against when you Kickstart the product they want if it doesn't turn out just the way they want it in the time they think is reasonable. Paying up front has a way of making people entitled as hell.</div> </div> </div> </div>To be fair, I wouldn't consider a decent amount of the Exalted complaints solely just the unfair moaning of entitled buyers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-19T12:41:10-07:00","id":990041,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/964724-whens-next-2nd-edition-book-coming-out?p=989998#post989998\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Man, have you SEEN how toxic the Exalted community became when E3 took longer than expected? The book is out, the Kickstarter has been fulfilled, but people are <i>still</i> bitter about the delay <i>because</i> they paid up front. If anything, Kickstarting E3 proved that existing fan bases turn against when you Kickstart the product they want if it doesn't turn out just the way they want it in the time they think is reasonable. Paying up front has a way of making people entitled as hell.</div> </div> </div> </div>fair enough, though i think when it's like dark eras, where you're getting the main book, plus another, I mean you can't expect it immediately right? you might have a timeline in your head for the main thing... but you can expect the other(s) later. That's more or less what I'm referring to. Same thing with Beast, we've got the core, I can wait a year for the next supplement.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-19T12:46:47-07:00","id":990044,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/964724-whens-next-2nd-edition-book-coming-out?p=990032#post990032\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To be fair, I wouldn't consider a decent amount of the Exalted complaints solely just the unfair moaning of entitled buyers.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, no, E3 did take way longer than it should have, and the fandom had every right to be upset about that. Just, not to the degree that some of them did.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-19T13:09:33-07:00","id":990060,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Thorbes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/964724-whens-next-2nd-edition-book-coming-out?p=989756#post989756\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Unless I misinterpreting your post I think you are underestimating how much time and effort running a kickstarter needs.</div> </div> </div> </div>p.s you were misinterpreting my post, because I'm suggesting that there are reasons, likely financial, that not everything has a kickstarter, in contrast to someone else saying that kickstarters are basically the only way to guarantee money now. I was saying it in a way to highlight if that were true they'd do it for everything.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-19T13:57:52-07:00","id":990085,"title":"","content":"I see. I do agree. Thanks for clarifying it for me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-21T01:04:23-07:00","id":990844,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/964724-whens-next-2nd-edition-book-coming-out?p=987475#post987475\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The Hollow Mekhet are a weird branch of the clan that date back to Ancient Egypt, where the Embrace is performed upon a corpse and they become Kindred hunted by their reflection/shadow.</div> </div> </div> </div> I could see them coming back in half damned as an alternate form of Reverant.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-21T01:09:03-07:00","id":990845,"title":"","content":"I think secrets of the covenants is going to be out any week now, just a guess on my part.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-21T01:25:13-07:00","id":990853,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/964724-whens-next-2nd-edition-book-coming-out?p=990844#post990844\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I could see them coming back in half damned as an alternate form of Reverant.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have to actually read the clanbook to make a more informed comment on this, but isn't the narrator (Frances) a Hollow Mekhet? Wouldn't it cause a pretty severe shift in portrayal to make them revenants?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-21T01:27:29-07:00","id":990855,"title":"","content":"Although <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clans_and_Bloodlines_in_Vampire:_The_Requiem#Mekhet\" target=\"_blank\">having seen this description</a> of Hollow Mekhet, I am going to buy that clanbook next. That sounds sooo darned cool and the Mekhet were already my favorite clan.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-21T05:47:24-07:00","id":990919,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Resplendent Fire</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/964724-whens-next-2nd-edition-book-coming-out?p=990853#post990853\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have to actually read the clanbook to make a more informed comment on this, but isn't the narrator (Frances) a Hollow Mekhet?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, she is Hollow.<br /> <br /> She being a Hollow one is seen by other Mekhets like a special case. Some of them are actually like her, most of them aren't. And all of them want to use her, knowing her Achille's heel. Being Hollow has some distinctive weaknesses (mainly, the ones who know the proper rites to do it can summon your Shadow and make her -or so it seems- work for them. Think about it. They have access to a monster who <i>looks like you and sounds like you, and knows you i<u>ntimately</u></i>) and i could see them as a Revenant of sorts, i suppose. However... they are too fully developed in themselves -i mean, as vampires- to be half-breeds, like the Revenants are. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Userhat Aegpts Vlrs. </span><span style=\"color:#996633\">Coren &quot;Ojos de Fuego&quot;. </span><span style=\"color:#666699\">Mithrael. </span><span style=\"color:#ffcc00\">Menehet.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1349-phersus","name":"Phersus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1349_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-26T19:02:39-07:00","id":993827,"title":"","content":"Ok not that I have spent a great deal of time watching to see how long a book stays in proofing but SotC has been there almost a month.<br /> <br /> Any news?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1117-overload","name":"overload","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1117_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-26T22:29:29-07:00","id":993897,"title":"","content":"The monday meeting notes are the most up-to-date information available, so if you've read them you know as much as we do. The fact that it's been in proofing for a month doesn't tell us much, as there are a lot of variables, so we can't really predict how long it will take.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-26T23:03:44-07:00","id":993908,"title":"","content":"I wouldn't be surprised if Secrets takes a long time in these final stages. If it's anything like the Clanbooks, which it is, it will be <i>intensely </i>asset-heavy, which just slows everything down.<br /> <br /> On the bright side, stuff like that is really awesome.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-27T00:35:03-07:00","id":993928,"title":"","content":"It will come soon enough.<br /> <br /> But yeah, it'd be cool if it came sooner than that. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-27T09:35:29-07:00","id":994071,"title":"","content":"So, I know about the playtest merits, but does anyone have any idea of what else might be in Secrets of the Covenants? Like new bloodlines, or is it mostly going to be how the covenants are structured and how some of their stuff works (like Wyrm's Nests). Honestly, I'm probably going to enjoy Secrets of the Covenants either way, but I was just wondering what might be in it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12436-ever-professional","name":"Ever Professional","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12436_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-27T09:45:44-07:00","id":994076,"title":"","content":"It said it was based on the clan book format, so I would expect most of it to be snippets of in-character documents and transcripts that would show what it's like being in the covenants and seeing them from the outside.<br /> <br /> The clan books had a running plot where someone was sort of strong-arming characters to find out the history of their clans, by speaking to members of them from different parts of the world, hunting down elders who have left a lot of their humanity behind, obscure bloodlines and clan-based rules systems like Hollow Mekhets and Malkavia, seeing what it was like when they were in charge or not. There was a lot of connections throughout the books and it was somewhat of a mystery who was doing it and why. That was with a combined page count of over six-hundred or something, however, including the mechanical sections at the end. It looks as if Secrets of the Covenants will be around 160 pages, though the mechanical sections will probably be shorter as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 10-27-2016, 12:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-27T10:01:53-07:00","id":994089,"title":"","content":"Ah, thanks for the answer. Yeah, I'll have to work on getting some 1e books so I can read up on them and possibly convert some stuff to 2e (I was a little disappointed in how few rites there were in the blood sorcery section of the book, though I understand that the books have a limited word count).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12436-ever-professional","name":"Ever Professional","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12436_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-27T10:22:51-07:00","id":994096,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ever Professional</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/964724-whens-next-2nd-edition-book-coming-out?p=994071#post994071\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, I know about the playtest merits, but does anyone have any idea of what else might be in Secrets of the Covenants? Like new bloodlines, or is it mostly going to be how the covenants are structured and how some of their stuff works (like Wyrm's Nests). Honestly, I'm probably going to enjoy Secrets of the Covenants either way, but I was just wondering what might be in it.</div> </div> </div> </div>The previews are probably the extent of the &quot;crunch&quot; that will be in the book. As Nofather said, Secrets is going to be done in the style of the Clan books, so primarily a collection of in-character documents with a small section of Merits and other &quot;crunch elements&quot; for each Covenant. <br /> <br /> Re: new Bloodlines, there probably won't be any in the book itself, but in the preview for the Invictus section we did see Courtesie (formerly Bloodline Discipline of the Spina) as a Fighting Style Merit. David mentioned that the plan had been to release a Spina writeup on the blog, which would have Gifts that work with and enhance the Fighting Style. That was quite some time ago though, plans could easily have changed since then.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-27T11:02:17-07:00","id":994110,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/964724-whens-next-2nd-edition-book-coming-out?p=993897#post993897\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The monday meeting notes are the most up-to-date information available, so if you've read them you know as much as we do. The fact that it's been in proofing for a month doesn't tell us much, as there are a lot of variables, so we can't really predict how long it will take.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah I understand. I just didn't know what all went into proofing. Figured it had to be more than spell check. <br /> <br /> Didn't know if proofing had ever been explained to the forum so we would have an idea what was going on.<br /> <br /> I would have thought that by the time it went to layout all the play test and crunch bits were worked out.<br /> <br /> Is proofing where it goes to the White Wolf all fathers for approval?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1117-overload","name":"overload","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1117_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-27T11:09:21-07:00","id":994117,"title":"","content":"Basically it's gone over with a rough-toothed comb, and one looks for errors in layout and presentation. Does a page reference a page that helps? Does a page reference nothing at all? Does the page reference reference the right page? The thing is, as I understand it, each time you correct the layout you risk altering other parts of it, so it takes several passes. I thought there was a Monday Meeting post about it but I can't remember off-hand.<br /> <br /> It says it's in its Final Layout Proof, so I would expect it to come out soon to be ready for advance product drafting. Maybe next Wednesday.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 10-27-2016, 02:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}